oob-usb-serial (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * interactive: add a framing menu applied via stty before the console opens.
    Choose an editable preset (from
    /usr/share/oob-usb-serial/serial_framings.txt) or "Custom" to set data
    bits, parity, stop bits and flow control individually.

