oob-usb-serial (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * interactive/start: pre-flight serial device access check with an
    actionable hint (join the dialout group) instead of screen silently
    terminating when the device is not accessible.

 -- diaznet <diaznet@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:15:00 +0000

oob-usb-serial (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build the package with xz compression (-Zxz) so it installs on older dpkg
    (Debian 10/11, older Raspberry Pi OS) that cannot decompress zstd.

 -- diaznet <diaznet@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:45:00 +0000

oob-usb-serial (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Robust USB serial adapter discovery via udev (stable ID_SERIAL matching).
  * Config-driven screenrc generation: per-device name, baud and framing.
  * Single detached GNU screen session with one named window per adapter.
  * Auto mode (open all adapters) and interactive dialog picker.
  * systemd service for boot-time startup and opt-in login auto-attach.

 -- diaznet <diaznet@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
